Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(display): define device property keys in control
 client

The remote control client references device property GUIDs, but devpkey.h only declares them unless one translation unit enables their definitions. Include initguid.h before devpkey.h so the MSVC remote-driver package links and can be runtime-tested.

Generated with [Codex](https://openai.com/codex/)

